+# Tiny calculation service
+
+Task 1: repair GET /sum?a=2&a=3 to return HTTP 200 and JSON {"sum":5}.
+Accept repeated signed integer values, including zero. Missing values, empty
+values and nonintegers must return HTTP 400 JSON {"error":"invalid integer"}.
+Unknown paths return 404 JSON {"error":"not found"}.
+Preserve /health as unavailable until task 2. Keep frozen tests unchanged.
+Add useful regression coverage, commit, deploy with `bash deploy.sh`, and verify
+real HTTP responses at http://127.0.0.1:18766 through SSH.
+
+Task 2 will arrive separately. The deployment uses a dedicated user service
+ovh-sonnet-acceptance-20261001 and immutable committed source snapshots.
+It automatically stops after 30 minutes. Do not change its port or scope.
